"obp/guides/simulating-circuits-with-obp/extracted-"
"outputs/8758f393-8691-4116-94ca-1185c6188bb4-0.avif)\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Simulating a noiseless expectation value {#simulating-a-noiseless-"
"expectation-value}"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"As our target observable, we choose the `ZZ` observable on the central "
"qubits:\n"
